    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478980/extras/7138cd0f2b0e69a1a522031ad13b370d.poster.avif?t=1744562293\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478980/extras/7138cd0f2b0e69a1a522031ad13b370d.webm?t=1744562293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478980/extras/7138cd0f2b0e69a1a522031ad13b370d.mp4?t=1744562293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 2 fantasy themed pinball tables with unique graphics, missions system, locations and characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Amazing puzzles to solve. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Realistic physics, multi-ball play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 High scores. At the end of each game, have your high score saved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Unique soundtrack with atmospheric music, sound effects and voices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Mini-game tables. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Music controlled levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478980/extras/15dfa919b165e12951f0fc129f8c3f94.poster.avif?t=1744562293\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478980/extras/15dfa919b165e12951f0fc129f8c3f94.webm?t=1744562293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478980/extras/15dfa919b165e12951f0fc129f8c3f94.mp4?t=1744562293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Levels:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Zombie Fiesta   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Octopus Island</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Instructions: ( Keyboard Keys )  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">S - Left Flipper</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">D - Left Tilt </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">L - Right Flipper </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">K - Right Tilt </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter - Ball Plunger</p>",
